    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You know how to turn ‘we did it’ into policy.”</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, when your party achieves a <strong>peaceful objective</strong> (successful negotiation, retreat, extraction, or surrender) where your symbolism, banners, or presence clearly mattered, you can formalize that victory into factionspace.</p><ul><li>After that scene resolves, you may convert <strong>1 Intrigue OP</strong> into either <strong>1 Diplomacy OP</strong> or <strong>1 Soft Power OP</strong> for your faction.</li><li>This represents codifying rumors, agreements, and personal heroics into actual structural leverage.</li></ul>",
